<figure class="workplace-matrix" aria-label="Workplace recommendation matrix">
  <div class="matrix-axis matrix-axis--y">WHAT THE WORK NEEDS</div>
  <div class="matrix-grid">
    <div class="matrix-cell"><span>01</span><h3>Privacy</h3><p>Confidential work, focused time, and appropriate conversation space.</p></div>
    <div class="matrix-cell matrix-cell--accent"><span>02</span><h3>Access</h3><p>Secure identity, connectivity, devices, and the right local route.</p></div>
    <div class="matrix-cell"><span>03</span><h3>Belonging</h3><p>Manager contact, team rituals, and a credible professional setting.</p></div>
    <div class="matrix-cell matrix-cell--blue"><span>04</span><h3>Flexibility</h3><p>A working arrangement that can change when the facts change.</p></div>
    <div class="matrix-cell"><span>05</span><h3>Accessibility</h3><p>Practical movement, equipment, ergonomics, and support for the person.</p></div>
    <div class="matrix-cell matrix-cell--gold"><span>06</span><h3>Review</h3><p>A date and owner for the next workplace decision.</p></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>A workplace recommendation is a reasoned operating choice—not a guarantee about local legal, safety, tax, or lease questions.</figcaption>
</figure>
